hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1884","[AI-translation] Abu Masood Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab Musalman apne ghar walon par kharch karey jabke wo uska sawaab ginta ho to wo uskey liye sadqa tha. (Bukhari: 5351)"
"1885","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bewa aur miskeen par koshish karney wala Allah key raastey mein jihaad karney waley jaisa hai. Ya raat ko qiyaam karney wala din ko roza rakhney wala. (Bukhari: 5353)"
"1886","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Bani Nazeer ki khajoorein bechtey they aur apne ghar walon key liye saal ka khaana rok letey they. (Bukhari: 5357). Khaanon ki kitaab."
